origin	https://github.com/meln5674/snobol4hs, the folder examples (the sample programs of a Haskell SNOBOL4), each .snobol4 extension written .sno; converted IN PLACE by sno_upcase_edition.py (Lon 2026-11-15: a simple regex, the spacing identical, one folder a collection): DOS line ends made LF, and built-in function names, keywords, the predefined names, the goto letters and END, RETURN, FRETURN, NRETURN in upper case, an angle-bracket subscript with square brackets, one character for one; the originals are at the origin
